NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT license above covers the original source code of this project
(the Swift sources in Sources/, the build scripts, and the icon generator).

This project is NOT a fork of 7-Zip and contains no 7-Zip source code. It is a
separate GUI application that invokes the official 7-Zip command-line binary
(7zz) as a subprocess. That binary is redistributed unmodified, bundled inside
the app, and remains under its own licenses (GNU LGPL 2.1+ with the unRAR
restriction, plus BSD-licensed parts).

See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and LICENSES/ for the full third-party terms.
